<title>USA: Fidelity Federal president adds CEO title.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Federal president adds CEO title.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Federal Bancorp said on Thursday that M. Brian Davis added the title of chief executive officer to his current posts of president, chief operating officer and director.</p>
<p>Davis replaces Bruce Cordingley, who will retain the chairman's post.</p>
